  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "comment": "A. ferrooxidans (obtained from the Biological Resource Center, National Institute of Technology and Evolution, Japan) was cultured in 0.5 g/L MgSO4·7H2O, 0.4 g/L (NH4)2SO4, 0.2 g/L K2HPO4, 0.1 g/L KCl, 10 mg/L FeSO4·7H2O, and 0.025% yeast extract (adjusted to pH 2.0 with 2 M H2SO4) at 45 °C79."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": ""
    }
